  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Responsible and Inclusive Business Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme aims to i) strengthen the enabling environment for UK and international business to implement RBC standards and ii) support the private sector&#x2019;s contribution to inclusive growth and accelerated delivery of the SDGs. It supports implementation of the UK&#x2019;s new RBC commitments to the OECD and revised guidelines. It renews the FCDO&#x2019;s programme partnerships with key multilateral and civil society delivery partners with the relevant expertise, geographical coverage and mandates, in support of shared objectives with DBT, with a view to informing design of a future multi-year programme.</narrative>
  </description>
